WEBVTT

00:00:08.905 --> 00:00:10.031
Mikleo!

00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:30.260
That must be the city where
the Lady of the Lake resides!

00:00:48.987 --> 00:00:55.577
The path you take extends far in the distance

00:00:55.785 --> 00:00:58.913
The wind's on our side, let's go

00:00:59.122 --> 00:01:05.712
The answers we seek won't be easy to find,

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:10.383
But we knew that before we set out

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:19.642
The footprints in our dreams
never lead in a straight path

00:01:19.851 --> 00:01:24.897
Adding as we go, our world map keeps growing

00:01:25.106 --> 00:01:27.650
Resonate, song of the wind

00:01:27.859 --> 00:01:32.697
Even with closed eyes,
our hearts push us forward

00:01:32.905 --> 00:01:38.411
The clouds we aim for are further, higher

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:41.164
Reach out, song of the wind

00:01:41.372 --> 00:01:46.252
Listen carefully and hear the voice
of our hearts bellowing

00:01:46.461 --> 00:01:51.424
Shine like a brilliant light

00:01:51.633 --> 00:01:55.178
You, become a blue melody

00:02:03.436 --> 00:02:10.610
"Chapter 3 - The Sacred Blade Festival"

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:15.782
Look, Mikleo! People all over!

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.993
Yeah, this is impressive indeed.

00:02:24.248 --> 00:02:26.250
Security checkpoint!

00:02:30.838 --> 00:02:33.049
Oh, I get it.

00:02:33.257 --> 00:02:37.053
You must be new in town.
You're here for the Sacred Blade Festival, right?

00:02:37.261 --> 00:02:42.934
You should hurry.
They're closing general admissions soon.

00:02:43.142 --> 00:02:45.645
Hurry? But...

00:02:45.853 --> 00:02:47.271
You do have a pass, right?

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.856
What's that?

00:02:49.065 --> 00:02:54.570
No pass? I mean, they'd still let you in,
but it'll take time.

00:02:54.779 --> 00:02:56.572
Really?!

00:02:58.157 --> 00:03:00.410
There's another way!

00:03:01.661 --> 00:03:05.957
We're a caravan of merchants
protected by a free trade treaty.

00:03:06.165 --> 00:03:08.334
We're the Sparrowfeathers.

00:03:08.543 --> 00:03:11.212
We can enter any city freely.

00:03:16.092 --> 00:03:20.179
Now you can freely wander around the town.

00:03:20.388 --> 00:03:21.472
Well?

00:03:23.057 --> 00:03:24.058
What is it?

00:03:24.267 --> 00:03:28.855
What? Money! 500 Gald.

00:03:29.063 --> 00:03:31.065
Nothing's for free, you know.

00:03:31.274 --> 00:03:34.026
Humans require money. That's what Gramps said.

00:03:34.235 --> 00:03:35.445
What?!

00:03:35.653 --> 00:03:37.196
You don't have money either?

00:03:37.405 --> 00:03:37.905
No.

00:03:38.114 --> 00:03:39.741
That's impossible!

00:03:39.949 --> 00:03:42.243
Show me that!

00:03:42.452 --> 00:03:44.120
Hey, wait...!

00:03:44.328 --> 00:03:47.039
Oh, look what I found!

00:03:51.586 --> 00:03:54.589
Not that. I have to return that to someone.

00:03:54.797 --> 00:03:56.966
Fine, I'll give it back.

00:03:57.175 --> 00:04:01.512
This seems like some kind of fate,
so I'll just say you owe me one.

00:04:01.721 --> 00:04:03.139
Lucky you, Sorey.

00:04:03.347 --> 00:04:05.475
Yeah, thanks!

00:04:14.066 --> 00:04:17.403
So, how are you liking
your first visit to Ladylake?

00:04:17.612 --> 00:04:21.574
| heard that it was a city of water,
but it's more than I imagined!

00:04:21.783 --> 00:04:23.075
So lively, right?

00:04:23.284 --> 00:04:24.035
Yeah.

00:04:24.243 --> 00:04:28.748
It's the Sacred Blade Festival,
so there are more people than usual.

00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:35.087
Oops, I have to get going.

00:04:35.296 --> 00:04:41.469
| almost forgot! We're here for business.
Time to make money!

00:04:41.677 --> 00:04:44.013
Enjoy the rest of the festival.

00:04:44.222 --> 00:04:46.933
Yeah. Thanks for everything!

00:04:56.526 --> 00:05:01.280
Sorey, we should start
looking for Alisha soon...

00:05:01.489 --> 00:05:03.282
Mikleo?!

00:05:03.491 --> 00:05:05.743
The malevolence is thick.

00:05:05.952 --> 00:05:09.705
Ladylake is full of malevolence.

00:05:15.336 --> 00:05:16.671
How do you feel, Mikleo?

00:05:16.879 --> 00:05:20.132
Yeah, I feel better now.

00:05:20.341 --> 00:05:21.551
Good.

00:05:25.805 --> 00:05:26.639
That's...

00:05:26.848 --> 00:05:28.099
Mikleo!

00:05:51.038 --> 00:05:52.248
Sorey!

00:05:59.297 --> 00:06:01.215
Why are you after Alisha?!

00:06:01.424 --> 00:06:02.091
Huh?

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:06.512
You attacked Elysia
to get to Alisha, didn't you?!

00:06:06.721 --> 00:06:09.140
Oh, that...

00:06:09.348 --> 00:06:13.019
I'm not targeting Princess Alisha.

00:06:13.227 --> 00:06:15.062
Then why are you even here?!

00:06:15.271 --> 00:06:19.191
Because I like her, that princess.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:24.989
Hanging around her will surely
present me with a good spectacle.

00:06:25.197 --> 00:06:27.533
But don't let your guard down.

00:06:27.742 --> 00:06:33.831
Just because I've stopped hunting her
doesn't mean nobody else is after her.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:40.546
The contract is still active.
She is a target for assassination.

00:06:40.755 --> 00:06:45.259
Someone who never stops before
they've fulfilled the contract is after her...

00:06:45.468 --> 00:06:47.762
Oh, the anticipation!

00:06:54.268 --> 00:06:57.396
Master, the town of Griel, after the incident...

00:06:57.605 --> 00:07:00.316
No survivors were found.

00:07:01.984 --> 00:07:05.696
| find your story hard to believe.

00:07:05.905 --> 00:07:07.740
It is all true.

00:07:07.949 --> 00:07:12.828
Is that why you argued
against Chancellor Bartlow?

00:07:13.037 --> 00:07:16.582
In all seriousness, not as a sarcastic jab
against those who want to conscript youngsters

00:07:16.791 --> 00:07:19.168
who visit the city for the festival?

00:07:19.377 --> 00:07:23.005
| was serious, Master Maltran.

00:07:23.214 --> 00:07:27.259
We should not be fighting
over resources in a war.

00:07:27.468 --> 00:07:31.931
Even in victory, war creates hate,
and the spiral of hate goes on.

00:07:32.139 --> 00:07:35.476
We must not allow war,
no matter what the reason.

00:07:35.685 --> 00:07:41.232
| think that applies even if it is
the opponent who strikes the first blow.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:45.861
But the upper brass will never accept.

00:07:47.238 --> 00:07:49.740
Think carefully before you act.

00:07:53.244 --> 00:07:55.204
Is that true?

00:07:55.413 --> 00:07:57.915
| did not expect the princess
to be this foolish.

00:07:58.124 --> 00:08:04.255
To assert that we must allow the enemy
to strike us first before we use our own force...

00:08:04.463 --> 00:08:05.881
So you...

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:11.178
Opposed her, of course.
But she would not listen.

00:08:11.387 --> 00:08:17.143
There is also a rumor that Princess Alisha
is connected to Rolance, in secret.

00:08:17.351 --> 00:08:22.356
So she has reasons to be against fighting.

00:08:22.565 --> 00:08:24.859
The reason we came here is
to determine whether or not

00:08:25.067 --> 00:08:28.487
the assassination of
Princess Alisha is justifiable.

00:08:28.696 --> 00:08:34.827
That decision is made based on how many
innocent lives can be spared by killing her.

00:08:35.036 --> 00:08:38.205
That is what we Scattered Bones
consider to be honor.

00:08:38.414 --> 00:08:46.547
In that case, I can assure you that the princess
is leading this country in the wrong direction.

00:08:46.756 --> 00:08:50.426
She is trying to sacrifice
the common folk for her ideals.

00:08:50.634 --> 00:08:56.015
In her words, an exclusively defensive policy.

00:08:56.223 --> 00:08:58.142
So soft.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:02.229
Chancellor Bartlow, your contract
to assassinate Princess Alisha...

00:09:02.438 --> 00:09:04.315
We accept.

00:09:17.203 --> 00:09:18.287
Oops.

00:09:19.622 --> 00:09:24.043
Today is the fifth and final day
of the Sacred Blade Festival.

00:09:24.251 --> 00:09:27.463
Now we begin the Rite of the Warrior.

00:09:36.514 --> 00:09:37.598
Huh?

00:09:45.314 --> 00:09:46.232
That's...

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:49.860
There's no doubt about it. She's a Seraph.

00:09:50.069 --> 00:09:53.614
So she must be the Lady of the Lake!

00:09:53.823 --> 00:09:56.117
The legends were true!

00:10:11.757 --> 00:10:14.051
The malevolence... so strong...

00:10:15.636 --> 00:10:17.596
This world is...

00:10:26.856 --> 00:10:28.607
Fellow citizens!

00:10:28.816 --> 00:10:29.817
For the past several years,

00:10:30.025 --> 00:10:36.323
we have abstained from our beloved festival
in light of the general state of the world.

00:10:36.532 --> 00:10:40.786
But this year, thanks to the grace
and assistance of our Lady Alisha,

00:10:40.995 --> 00:10:43.414
the Sacred Blade Festival can be held once more.

00:10:49.628 --> 00:10:52.923
This is getting interesting!

00:10:53.132 --> 00:10:55.843
So pulling that sword out
makes you the Shepherd?

00:10:56.051 --> 00:11:01.599
It probably means you are accepted
by the Lady of the Lake

00:11:01.807 --> 00:11:05.144
as someone worthy of being the Shepherd.

00:11:05.352 --> 00:11:06.979
Worthy...

00:11:09.106 --> 00:11:11.233
So that must be the last one.

00:11:11.442 --> 00:11:15.487
How does the princess intend
to bring closure to this farce?

00:11:18.657 --> 00:11:22.703
Oh, is Alisha going to do something?

00:11:27.291 --> 00:11:35.049
First, I'd like to ask for your applause for the
10 warriors here and all others who attended.

00:11:38.427 --> 00:11:43.557
Unfortunately, no Shepherd appeared
during this Sacred Blade Festival.

00:11:43.766 --> 00:11:48.187
According to legend, the Shepherd is
a savior who works together with the Seraphim

00:11:48.395 --> 00:11:51.273
to cleanse the world of malevolence.

00:11:51.482 --> 00:11:57.446
However, I did not organize this Sacred Blade
Festival because I blindly believed in legend.

00:11:57.655 --> 00:12:04.161
Our nation, Hyland, and our neighbor, Rolance,
are in a state of heightened tension.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:07.122
There are some that believe
this festival is intended

00:12:07.331 --> 00:12:11.752
to raise morale before a war,
but I disagree.

00:12:11.961 --> 00:12:18.884
The legend also states that humans were able
to see the Seraphim and live together with them.

00:12:19.093 --> 00:12:26.684
| interpreted that to mean that you must
coexist with your neighbor, not go to war.

00:12:28.143 --> 00:12:29.478
Mikleo?

00:12:29.687 --> 00:12:33.857
| believe that, especially because of
recent calamities, we must be brave.

00:12:34.066 --> 00:12:41.657
Even if Rolance decides to invade us,
we must not strike first.

00:12:41.865 --> 00:12:45.411
We must wait until they attack us.

00:12:45.619 --> 00:12:53.460
The malevolence... The audience's fear,
dissatisfaction, negative emotions...

00:12:53.669 --> 00:12:55.546
Creating more malevolence.

00:12:58.465 --> 00:13:00.259
This is not good.

00:13:00.467 --> 00:13:01.802
Alisha!

00:13:13.314 --> 00:13:15.065
What's going on?

00:13:16.358 --> 00:13:19.320
Sorey, we have to get out of here!

00:13:45.554 --> 00:13:48.307
That's... a Hellion!

00:14:01.945 --> 00:14:04.239
What is that?! The fire...!

00:14:23.175 --> 00:14:24.510
That's...!

00:14:24.718 --> 00:14:26.053
Sorey!

00:14:33.435 --> 00:14:34.686
Alisha!

00:14:36.438 --> 00:14:38.107
Sorey?

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:47.533
Sorey, why are you here?

00:14:57.292 --> 00:15:00.295
Sorey, what's going on?

00:15:00.504 --> 00:15:03.424
So I guess you can't see it.

00:15:03.632 --> 00:15:04.258
Wait here!

00:15:04.466 --> 00:15:06.343
Sorey!

00:15:06.552 --> 00:15:08.387
Lady of the Lake!

00:15:10.889 --> 00:15:12.891
You are...?

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:14.893
I'm Sorey.

00:15:15.102 --> 00:15:19.064
Lady of the Lake, can't you do
anything with that Hellion?!

00:15:20.566 --> 00:15:25.571
Only Shepherds can purify Hellions.

00:15:25.779 --> 00:15:27.239
Shepherd...

00:15:30.534 --> 00:15:35.706
Sorey, can you really see the Seraphim?

00:15:59.688 --> 00:16:00.939
Alisha!

00:16:02.524 --> 00:16:03.901
Who are you?

00:16:04.109 --> 00:16:06.778
You cause suffering amongst the people.

00:16:06.987 --> 00:16:08.071
What...?

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.076
Wait!

00:16:13.285 --> 00:16:16.038
The princess can fend for herself.

00:16:16.246 --> 00:16:20.876
You must evacuate the audience at once!
Do you understand?

00:16:22.127 --> 00:16:25.255
You too! This is an order--

00:16:39.978 --> 00:16:42.648
Stay away, Sorey!

00:16:42.856 --> 00:16:49.112
Don't worry about me.
| need you to handle this situation.

00:16:49.321 --> 00:16:55.118
Even if I can't, you can. I feel that's true.

00:16:55.327 --> 00:16:57.538
Sorey... please.

00:17:02.334 --> 00:17:04.378
One moment.

00:17:04.586 --> 00:17:09.883
If you can see me, you must have
some relation to the Seraphim.

00:17:10.092 --> 00:17:13.345
Perhaps you can draw that sword.

00:17:13.554 --> 00:17:18.141
But first, Sorey, I must ask you.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:21.019
Why do you want to be the Shepherd?

00:17:21.228 --> 00:17:24.064
May I ask you your name?

00:17:24.273 --> 00:17:27.150
Oh, of course. I am Lailah.

00:17:27.359 --> 00:17:32.573
Lailah. My dream is to investigate
ancient ruins all over the world!

00:17:32.781 --> 00:17:36.034
| believe that the legends
of the past hold knowledge

00:17:36.243 --> 00:17:38.996
about how humans and Seraphim
might one day live in harmony together.

00:17:39.204 --> 00:17:45.127
My dream is to find a way to let humans
and Seraphim live happily together.

00:17:45.335 --> 00:17:50.257
If purifying the Hellions will save
both humans and Seraphim, then...

00:17:50.465 --> 00:17:55.178
Then I think that's all connected
to the dream I'm chasing!

00:17:55.387 --> 00:17:59.933
So Lailah, I...

00:18:13.947 --> 00:18:18.201
To become my sword is to serve
as a vessel for me to dwell in

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:21.288
and to assume the Shepherd's burden.

00:18:21.496 --> 00:18:26.251
Blessed with the power of purification
and abilities beyond humankind.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:31.131
Cursed to be scorned by
others and wrought with despair.

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:35.636
You may be forced to make agonizing decisions.

00:18:35.844 --> 00:18:40.766
It is a lonely battle that
you can scarcely imagine.

00:18:40.974 --> 00:18:44.102
That's the burden of the Shepherd?

00:18:44.311 --> 00:18:45.395
Yes.

00:18:49.858 --> 00:18:54.655
| accept, as long as that allows me
to save these people here.

00:18:54.863 --> 00:18:59.201
| believe the path of the Shepherd
leads me to my dream!

00:19:01.787 --> 00:19:03.872
I---

00:19:04.081 --> 00:19:05.916
...will become the Shepherd!

00:19:57.718 --> 00:20:00.387
"Fethmus Mioma." That's your...

00:20:00.595 --> 00:20:03.557
Yes, my true name.

00:20:07.144 --> 00:20:11.273
Now, Sorey!
Harness the overflowing power within you!

00:20:11.481 --> 00:20:14.025
Unleash the true power of the Shepherd...

00:20:16.445 --> 00:20:17.612
...now!

00:20:44.431 --> 00:20:47.184
Shepherd...

00:20:47.392 --> 00:20:49.603
I-Impossible!

00:21:05.911 --> 00:21:07.204
Sorey!

00:21:14.961 --> 00:21:19.966
If right now [ close my eyes,

00:21:21.676 --> 00:21:28.266
I'm on a journey with no return

00:21:28.475 --> 00:21:40.278
When a brief lull comes,
we sleep embracing our desires

00:21:40.487 --> 00:21:47.619
And what we see in our dreams
lights up our world

00:21:47.828 --> 00:21:54.876
It's in this budding passion
that we find our hope

00:21:55.085 --> 00:22:02.717
Let's rest our wings for tomorrow

00:22:02.926 --> 00:22:08.390
We're only able to laugh like we are,

00:22:08.598 --> 00:22:14.354
Because at the end of our journey,

00:22:14.563 --> 00:22:21.486
It will surely be ours--
a sense we've done our duty

00:22:21.695 --> 00:22:32.414
So let's envision our future and sleep

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:39.337
Let's all go together

00:22:41.089 --> 00:22:44.718
"Next episode preview"

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:50.223
Sorey, Mikleo, I look forward to
travelling with you from here on out.

00:22:50.432 --> 00:22:52.684
The pleasure is mine!

00:22:52.893 --> 00:22:57.147
Mikleo, why aren't you saying anything?
And what's with that face?

00:22:57.355 --> 00:23:00.066
You told me last week to do funny faces!

00:23:00.275 --> 00:23:02.694
Uh, really? I forgot.

00:23:02.903 --> 00:23:05.572
Seriously... Nice to meet you, Lailah.

00:23:05.780 --> 00:23:07.532
Nice to meet you too, Mikleo.

00:23:07.741 --> 00:23:09.576
Tell us about yourself, Lailah.

00:23:09.784 --> 00:23:11.411
Certainly.

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:12.495
What's your hobby?

00:23:12.704 --> 00:23:15.415
| like origami and sending letters.

00:23:15.624 --> 00:23:17.083
What snacks are you best at making?

00:23:17.292 --> 00:23:21.880
Since I am a Seraph of fire,
| am good with baked goods.

00:23:22.088 --> 00:23:23.965
What does Fethmus Mioma mean?

00:23:24.174 --> 00:23:26.927
It means "Lailah the Pure."

00:23:27.135 --> 00:23:27.844
How much do you weigh?

00:23:28.053 --> 00:23:29.346
That's a secret.

00:23:29.554 --> 00:23:30.305
Your age?

00:23:30.513 --> 00:23:31.514
That's a secret.

00:23:31.723 --> 00:23:32.891
Next week's episode?

00:23:33.099 --> 00:23:33.850
That's a secret.

00:23:34.059 --> 00:23:36.019
You can't hide that from us!

00:23:36.227 --> 00:23:39.230
Next week, "Destiny of the Shepherd."
Look forward to it!
